{"t":"Well of Life","s":"well-of-life-a166d","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Well_of_Life_aabd97.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 300px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"A small view of the Well of Life\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"158\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Well_of_Life_aabd97.png\" width=\"300\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">A small view of the Well of Life</p> </figcaption> </figure><p> The <b>Well of Life</b>, or the Fountain of Life, as it is more known, <i>completely refills your health</i>.\n</p><p>It is located at the <a href=\"#/wiki/Pits%20of%20Inferno\">Pits of Inferno</a> entrance <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32806,32321,11\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32806, 32321, 11)</a>. This place has some butterflies and flowers which are used in a quest, but isn't the only spot where player can find these creatures/flowers.\n</p><p>It's a beautiful place to take screenshots with friends, although it's not easy to get here as a low-leveled player.\n</p><p>When you use it for the first time, you'll get the following message:<br/>\n<span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">You feel very refreshed and relaxed.</span>\n</p><p>When you use it again, you'll get the following message:<br/>\n<span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">You have already drunk from the fountain of life.</span>\n</p><p><br/>\nIf you drink water from this fountain, you may get the achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Fountain%20of%20Life\">Fountain of Life</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"0104f4a11b8fa7ad109dff407e03c73f\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:402px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:402px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Well_of_life_panorama-PNG\" style=\"position: relative; height:399px; width:373px; top:0.5px;\"><img alt=\"A player getting the achievement Fountain of Life\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"A player getting the achievement &lt;i&gt;Fountain of Life&lt;/i&gt;\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Well_of_life_panorama_dbe1cd.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Well of life panorama.PNG (1.32 MB)\" width=\"400\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:400px;\">A player getting the achievement <i>Fountain of Life</i></div></div></div></div>","quests":["the-pits-of-inferno-quest"]}